@startuml
title Hiking Elevation Pipeline

actor User

entity "Wikidata" as WD
entity "OSM (Overpass API)" as OSM
entity "Lantmäteriet STAC API" as DEM
entity "Python App" as App
database "Local DEM Storage" as Storage

User -> App: Start process (QIDs)
App -> WD: Fetch OSM relation ID
WD --> App: Return relation ID

App -> OSM: Fetch trail geometry
OSM --> App: Return LineString

App -> DEM: Fetch DEM tiles
DEM --> Storage: Save GeoTIFF files
Storage --> App: Load DEM raster

App -> App: Sample elevation along LineString
App -> App: Compute ascent/descent
App --> User: Return profile (ascent/descent)

@enduml
